  "_note": "JOINT_LIMITS.md section 2: roll only while abs(head yaw) <= yaw_window_deg, then abs(roll) <= roll_max_deg; yaw only while abs(roll) <= roll_free_deg. The independent review measured a small collision exactly at yaw 2.5 / roll 15, so both limits are pulled in by a margin. The margins are placeholders until the review gives numbers. REVIEW 2026-11-14: inside the documented window the head base cuts into the head-pitch U (0.16-0.40 mm at yaw -2 to -2.5 with roll -10 to -15); clear at yaw +-1 with roll up to +-15. yaw_margin_deg 1.5 keeps roll to abs(yaw) <= 1.0 until the part is fixed or the boundary is re-measured.",
